# Steam Free Weekend Bot

A Node.js bot that polls Steam and alerts when free weekend games are detected.

## Environment variables

```env
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=
STEAM_BOT_ACCOUNT_NAME=
STEAM_BOT_PASSWORD=
TARGET_STEAM_GROUP_ID=
CHECK_INTERVAL_MINUTES=60
DATABASE_PATH=./data/games.db
```

## Setup

```bash
npm install
cp .env.example .env
npm run setup
npm start
```
